-- reflection of an arrangement: (a, b, c) read as (c, b, a). The rotation from (a, b, c) to (b, c, a)
-- goes to the path from (c, b, a) to (a, c, b), which is the rotation of (a, c, b) run backwards.
cyc-rev : (A : Type 0) → Cyc A → Cyc A
cyc-rev A z =
  case z return (λ w → Cyc A) of
    cyc a b c → cyc c b a
    cyc-rot a b c i → cyc-rot a c b (~ i)
